WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.470
- We want to celebrate a
remarkable woman together

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.170
and share the story of Erica Gamble,

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:10.010
also known as the wig doctor
from Marietta, Georgia.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.997
Just take a look.

00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:15.110
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.883
- Hair means confidence.

00:00:17.919 --> 00:00:19.370
Hair means power.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.960
Hair means character.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.970
If I can provide people
a hair loss solution,

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:28.140
then I know that I'm doing
what I'm called to do.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.110
I am Dr. Erica Bamble,

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.143
but everyone knows me as the wig doctor.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:38.340
The Wig Doctor opened in June
of 2015 in Marietta, Georgia,

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.400
to service people

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.200
who are going through
chemotherapy treatments,

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.853
auto immune disorders, or life changes.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.200
90% of the people who
walk through this door

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.600
have never worn a wig

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:59.040
and they have no idea what a wig entails.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:02.510
My clients become almost like family.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:05.920
I had a situation where
I had a little girl,

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:10.220
she was still in school and
she lost all of her hair.

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.100
After seeing a family go
through something such as that,

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:16.070
it was really one of the main reasons

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:19.430
why I continue to do what I do.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:22.380
There are times when my clients
come through these doors

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.420
and they often feel wounded.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.260
It is my responsibility

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.673
to make them feel like
warriors when they leave.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:33.630
The struggles of small
business are, for me,

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:35.390
being a one person show.

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:36.470
I do it all.

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:39.810
Marketing is difficult
because I often feel

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:42.680
that I don't have the
tools or the resources

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:46.770
to reach the people that I
might be missing in the market.

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:50.910
I started this business
using my own resources,

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:54.270
buying what I thought would be necessary.

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:58.190
I've spent a lot of my own
money to support my clients,

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:00.040
to make sure that they have

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:03.963
everything that they need from me.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.140
- I'm here with Gabrielle Union,

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.130
fellow beauty business
owner and entrepreneur,

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:12.880
and joining us is Dr. Erica Gamble,

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.970
popularly known as the wig doctor.

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:17.023
Hi, Erica.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:24.090
I watched your video and
I was just overwhelmed

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:28.820
with your story and what
an amazing person you are.

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:32.680
And over the course of
obviously the last eight months

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.020
and how it's impacted everyone,

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.960
I know how much the coronavirus

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.780
has impacted small businesses.

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:40.020
Will you speak about that?

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:42.680
'Cause I know you put so much
of your own money into this.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:45.820
- Yeah, finances have been
really hard during this time.

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.660
You know, honestly, the doors aren't,

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:52.486
they're not opening as much
as they did prior to COVID.

00:02:52.486 --> 00:02:54.740
And so one thing for certain

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.920
is that even though COVID is happening

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:58.330
and we're in a pandemic,

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:01.540
cancer diagnosis don't stop,

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.500
hair loss issues don't stop,

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.190
auto immune diseases don't stop.

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:08.107
And so I still have people
who are calling me saying,

00:03:08.107 --> 00:03:10.290
"Hey, I need help."

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.270
I am not saying no to anyone that calls

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:16.200
or anybody who walks through the door

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:20.170
because the people in this
community really do need me.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.890
And it's just been a challenge.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:23.640
- And Gabrielle when you were speaking

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.650
about going through IVF

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:27.490
and having a change in your hair

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.810
and a lot of women, when they have babies,

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.700
also their hair changes,

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.930
or if they're going through
something like chemotherapy

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:39.700
and all of the deep important,
difficult things to discuss

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:43.190
such as you live your life by Erica.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:48.190
I mean, hair loss is a
tremendous psychological thing

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:52.910
for really women and men.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.650
But can you guys speak to that?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.543
- There's so much shame involved.

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:01.340
For so many women, and
certainly women of color,

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.700
and then specifically black
women, our hair is our crown.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.400
And when your crown has
been knocked off your head,

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:12.010
you feel less than, you
feel self conscious,

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.590
you lack the confidence.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:19.070
I know when I was
experiencing bald patches,

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.500
I only wore wigs.

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.490
If I didn't have a wig,

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.560
you would have never seen me.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.560
I wouldn't have been
able to shoot my show.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.920
And that's not life and death.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.540
And what Erica is talking about

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:29.450
and what she's dealing with

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.270
and what her customers are dealing with,

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.410
this is life and death.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.060
And how do you move through the world

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:35.910
as you're battling for your life.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:38.490
A great wig can change your life, child,

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:39.690
it can change your life.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.670
And so you are doing the Lord's work

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.160
and I cannot say enough.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.823
And when you lean into service for others,

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:53.660
the work comes in leaps and
bounds and it comes in spades.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.580
And so my advice would be

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.640
to continue to lead into service

00:04:57.640 --> 00:05:02.640
because blessings, God, karma,
whatever you want to say,

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.690
it comes back to you

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:07.630
and you will reap everything
that you are sowing

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.400
and because you're such a beautiful,

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.240
beautiful woman doing such amazing work,

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:13.550
this will come back to you

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.890
in ways that you can't
even begin to imagine.

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:18.370
And I just want to thank you,

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:22.440
as someone who has relied
on wigs in my darkest hour,

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:23.490
I just want to thank you

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:25.020
and so many others in the community

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.220
who desperately need you.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.650
So please hold on, help is coming.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:32.180
- And Erica, use us as
a billboard right now.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.740
- Yes, I would love to
use you as a billboard.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:36.470
I mean I think it would be amazing

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:37.990
and that's where I need help.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:39.740
Honestly, at the end of the day,

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:42.790
no matter how often I think
about giving up and quitting,

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:44.640
which is literally really every day-

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.930
- Don't you dare, okay.

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:49.460
We want to contribute.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:54.460
What you are doing is so vital
and important to empowerment.

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:56.360
You are, as Gabrielle said,

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.630
doing life or death business,

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:01.410
you are changing people's psyche

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.580
and the confidence that they have.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.880
So we at Flower Beauty, actually,

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.367
we're launching hair
tools on September 30th,

00:06:10.367 --> 00:06:13.720
and we're gonna send you a ton of stuff.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.360
We want to help style your clients.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:19.150
I want to shine a big light on Flawless.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.370
I think Gabrielle, what you are doing,

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.300
is so crucial and important,

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:27.985
again to that confidence
and how you live your life.

00:06:27.985 --> 00:06:32.060
And I just have such deep
respect for what you're doing.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:36.520
And also I do know an
amazing social media guru

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:40.110
who I'd love to help give you some tips

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:42.710
and get you started on the right path

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.990
and we'll help along the way.

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:47.950
And Gabrielle and I
want to help support you

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:48.860
and your efforts.

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:50.770
So together with Flower Hair tools,

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:54.430
we're gifting you this $10,000 check

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.847
just to get you started.

00:06:56.847 --> 00:06:58.312
- Thank you.

00:06:58.312 --> 00:07:01.580
(audience applause)

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.940
- And Erica, we're gonna make
you our WCW for this Wednesday

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.884
to coincide with the episode.

00:07:07.884 --> 00:07:09.503
(screaming)

00:07:09.503 --> 00:07:11.680
So we'll make sure to blow
it up as much as possible

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.370
on my personal page and
on the Flawless pages.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:15.203
- Thank you.

00:07:15.203 --> 00:07:16.500
Oh my gosh, you just don't know

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:19.050
what this really, really means.

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:20.470
I'm just like floored.

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:22.520
Thank you, I appreciate it.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:24.320
- Thank you both for being here.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.790
Dr. Erica Gamble, the wig doctor

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.020
and Gabrielle Union,

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:30.910
grab a bitsy snack and watch
her on "L.A.'s Finest".

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:33.043
Thank you so much you guys.

00:07:33.043 --> 00:07:35.710
(upbeat music)

